# Harvest working files. The journal is a crash-recovery log written every 250 frames so an
# interrupted crawl resumes rather than starting again; the parquet beside it is the actual
# catalogue. Mapillary's reached 171 MB, over GitHub's file limit, and versioning a recovery
# log is not what it is for.
**/observations/journal.jsonl
**/observations/boxes_done.txt
